  ],
  "description": "Engaged mono Echo Out of the five-control EH7850 circuit, with mixer, pre-emphasis, two MN3005s and interstage gain, two output reconstruction filters, de-emphasis and the Chorus/Vibrato switch. The NE570 stages use matched full-wave current averaging and feedback compression/feedforward expansion. The CD4047 is represented by a shared period control calibrated to the original 8\u201310 \u00b5s and 120\u2013140 \u00b5s service intervals. The two output taps of each bucket brigade are combined, and the clock-dependent diode capacitance is approximated by period modulation proportional to Delay. The negative supply and filtered audio reference are DC sources. Bypass, Direct Out, overload indicator and clock feedthrough are outside this effect model. The two fixed-frequency RC4558 LFO modes use calibrated triangle waveforms through the analog depth and smoothing network.",
  "io": {
    "groundNode": "0",
    "inputNode": "in",
    "outputNode": "out"
  },
  "layout": {
    "pots": [
      "VR1",
      "VR2",
      "VR3",
      "VR4",
      "VR5"
    ],
    "switches": [
      "Vibrato"
    ]
  },
  "name": "EHX Deluxe Memory Man",
